---
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  heading="Disclaimer"
  updated={site.legalUpdated}
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="ToolKade's calculators give estimates for guidance only and are not financial, tax or legal advice. Confirm important figures with the official authority."
>
  <h2>Estimates, not advice</h2>
  <p>
    The calculators and tools on {site.name} are provided for general information and guidance only. Results
    are estimates and are <strong>not</strong> financial, tax, legal, customs or professional advice.
  </p>

  <h2>Rates can change</h2>
  <p>
    Sri Lankan tax brackets, EPF and ETF rules, vehicle import duties, electricity tariffs and similar figures
    are set by government bodies and change from time to time, sometimes at short notice. Each calculator
    shows the date we last verified its rates and links to the official source. If a rate has changed since
    then, the result may be wrong.
  </p>

  <h2>Check with the official authority</h2>
  <p>Before you make a financial decision, confirm the figures with the relevant authority, for example:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Inland Revenue Department (APIT and income tax)</li>
    <li>Sri Lanka Customs and the Ministry of Finance (vehicle import duty)</li>
    <li>
      Ceylon Electricity Board, LECO and the Public Utilities Commission of Sri Lanka (electricity tariffs)
    </li>
    <li>Your bank or leasing company (loan and leasing terms)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>No liability</h2>
  <p>
    {site.name} does not accept liability for any loss or damage caused by relying on results from this site.
    See our
    <a href="/terms/">terms of use</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Spotted an error?</h2>
  <p>
    If you notice a rate that has changed or a result that looks wrong, please <a href="/contact/">tell us</a>{' '}
    so we can fix it quickly.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
